    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Urban Entrepreneur!<br>Are you ready to open a store?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648080/extras/3e218e5cdcdbf7b75f12fcbc6fef3721.poster.avif?t=1713025959\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648080/extras/3e218e5cdcdbf7b75f12fcbc6fef3721.webm?t=1713025959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648080/extras/3e218e5cdcdbf7b75f12fcbc6fef3721.mp4?t=1713025959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;Urban Entrepreneur&quot; is a captivating simulation and strategy game that puts players in the role of an ambitious business manager, ready to build a thriving empire in a bustling, ever-changing city. With a focus on players who enjoy simulation and strategy games, this modern game targets both casual and hardcore gamers, catering to young adults and adults interested in business and entrepreneurship.<br><br>The game starts with a small store in a local shopping center, and it's up to the players to attract customers by offering high-quality products and exceptional customer service. As their business expands, players will need to hire employees, build relationships with suppliers and customers, and compete in challenges to obtain exclusive rights to sell special items unavailable elsewhere. To stay ahead of the competition, players must expertly manage inventory, pricing, and marketing strategies, all while navigating the complex web of city taxes and laws.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648080/extras/58b7414960281ba3e01d9db6839d3643.poster.avif?t=1713025959\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648080/extras/58b7414960281ba3e01d9db6839d3643.webm?t=1713025959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648080/extras/58b7414960281ba3e01d9db6839d3643.mp4?t=1713025959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The innovative AI &quot;State-Machine&quot; ensures that employees and customers react quickly and realistically, providing a truly immersive experience. Employees have unique traits and skills, requiring expert management to hire, train, and discipline them effectively. Players must also manage employee stress levels, as neglecting staff can lead to high turnover rates.<br><br>Customers, on the other hand, are picky yet prone to manipulation. Players must employ various tactics to entice customers to spend more, such as carefully selecting store music, adjusting lighting, and strategically placing products to encourage impulse buys. Time spent in the store can also induce &quot;choice fatigue,&quot; further influencing customer purchasing behavior.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648080/extras/d785a2cf2b40bc58ae5ee4674cebc579.poster.avif?t=1713025959\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648080/extras/d785a2cf2b40bc58ae5ee4674cebc579.webm?t=1713025959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648080/extras/d785a2cf2b40bc58ae5ee4674cebc579.mp4?t=1713025959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;Urban Entrepreneur&quot; features three types of events that can change daily store operations: random events, semi-predictable occurrences, and scheduled events, such as the infamous Black Friday. Players must adapt their strategies to respond to these events and maintain a successful business.<br><br>Additionally, players can implement policies to shape the way their store operates, such as requiring customer memberships, adjusting store hours, and offering employee benefits. This level of customization allows players to craft a unique experience tailored to their preferred playstyle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648080/extras/1205ffee04b49664aa66cc5861c02237.poster.avif?t=1713025959\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648080/extras/1205ffee04b49664aa66cc5861c02237.webm?t=1713025959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648080/extras/1205ffee04b49664aa66cc5861c02237.mp4?t=1713025959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;Urban Entrepreneur&quot; delivers an immersive and challenging simulation game that tests players' business acumen in a dynamic, ever-evolving cityscape. With its unique features, customization options, and engaging gameplay, &quot;Urban Entrepreneur&quot; is poised to become a popular title in the simulation and strategy genres, shining a light on the challenges faced by new entrepreneurs and the exhilaration of growing a business in a saturated market.",
